    },
    "water_herald": {
      "Ashwick was the youngest runner ever to carry the Concord's messages.": "tender",
      "He was still running when he fell.": "grief",
      "I think he had forgotten where to.": "grief",
      "At the heart of the burning reeds stood a tower of ice that had not melted.": "awe",
      "Inside it waited a blind girl who said she had been expecting us.": "whisper"
